Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person1:
	.string "JUBILIFE is the biggest city in\n"
	.string "SINNOH. I got lost three times on my\l"
	.string "first day!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person2:
	.string "The TV station broadcasts battles\n"
	.string "live. I'm practicing my winning pose,\l"
	.string "just in case.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person3:
	.string "The TRAINERS' SCHOOL is right over\n"
	.string "there. The teacher is nice, but the\l"
	.string "tests are tough!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person4:
	.string "Did you know you can see the whole\n"
	.string "city from the top of the TV station?\l"
	.string "I'm going to go up there someday.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person5:
	.string "When I was young, this was a quiet\n"
	.string "little town. Now look at it! Buildings\l"
	.string "everywhere.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person6:
	.string "I'm going to be a TRAINER after\n"
	.string "school. I already picked a name for my\l"
	.string "first MOéMON!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person7:
	.string "Every morning I walk my MOéMON around\n"
	.string "the plaza. It knows the way better\l"
	.string "than I do.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person8:
	.string "PROF. ROWAN sent me to JUBILIFE for\n"
	.string "supplies. This city is huge!\p"
	.string "I got lost twice on the way to the\n"
	.string "MART. Don't tell the PROFESSOR.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person18:
	.string "We're TEAM GALACTIC. We're... uh,\n"
	.string "conducting a survey.\p"
	.string "Question one: how much would you pay\n"
	.string "for a better universe?$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person19:
	.string "Move along, kid. Nothing to see here.\n"
	.string "Just two totally normal people in\l"
	.string "matching space suits.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person25:
	.string "Hello hello! The PÓKETCH COMPANY is\n"
	.string "giving away a brand-new watch!\p"
	.string "The PRESIDENT himself is handing them\n"
	.string "out. Their building's right over there!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person26:
	.string "Answer this: what's round, beeps, and\n"
	.string "tells the time?\p"
	.string "A PÓKETCH, of course! Ha ha!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person27:
	.string "I'm waiting for a friend. We're going to\n"
	.string "battle in the plaza, where everyone\l"
	.string "can watch!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person28:
	.string "I'm practicing my juggling for the\n"
	.string "PÓKETCH campaign. One ball... two\l"
	.string "balls... oops.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person29:
	.string "Shh, I'm in the middle of a game! ...Aw, I\n"
	.string "lost. It's okay, I'll try again.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person30:
	.string "My friend and I trade MOéMON every\n"
	.string "Sunday. Today I'm giving away my best\l"
	.string "one!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person31:
	.string "I collect TRAINER CARDS. Yours is from\n"
	.string "overseas? That's a rare one!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Person32:
	.string "LOOKER: Ah! You have noticed me. I am\n"
	.string "LOOKER, of the INTERNATIONAL POLICE.\p"
	.string "I am investigating a certain group in\n"
	.string "strange outfits. If you see them, be\l"
	.string "careful.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign9:
	.string "JUBILIFE CITY\p"
	.string "The most modern city in SINNOH, where\n"
	.string "people and MOéMON meet.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign10:
	.string "JUBILIFE CITY\p"
	.string "The most modern city in SINNOH, where\n"
	.string "people and MOéMON meet.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign11:
	.string "JUBILIFE CITY\p"
	.string "The most modern city in SINNOH, where\n"
	.string "people and MOéMON meet.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign12:
	.string "JUBILIFE CITY\p"
	.string "The most modern city in SINNOH, where\n"
	.string "people and MOéMON meet.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign13:
	.string "JUBILIFE CONDOMINIUMS\p"
	.string "Homes with a view of the city.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign14:
	.string "The company that makes watches for\n"
	.string "TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "Closed for remodeling.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign15:
	.string "JUBILIFE TV\p"
	.string "Bringing SINNOH's best battles to\n"
	.string "your home.$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign16:
	.string "TRAINERS' SCHOOL\p"
	.string "Learn the basics, then go beyond\n"
	.string "them!$"

Sinnoh_JubilifeCity_Text_Sign23:
	.string "GLOBAL TERMINAL\p"
	.string "Under construction. Please come back\n"
	.string "later!$"

